  "integrity": "After removing the single anchored comment, text matches the opened file exactly when blank lines and emphasis delimiters are normalized. Roughdraft changed spacing and asterisks to underscores; Markdown AST identity is not claimed. Complete body, footnotes and guide are retained.",
